<h3 style='margin-top:16px;color:#1e1b4b;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;'>Section A: Physics Numerical & Diagrams</h3><p style='font-style:italic;color:#555;'>Note: Show all calculations.</p><div style='margin-bottom:10px;'><strong>Q1.</strong> For the Wheatstone bridge shown below, determine whether the bridge is balanced.</div><div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0;'><img src='data:image/png;base64,' style='max-width:320px;max-height:220px;' alt='Diagram'></div><ul style='list-style-type:none;padding-left:15px;margin-top:4px;'><li style='margin-bottom:2px;'>(a) Balanced</li><li style='margin-bottom:2px;'>(b) Unbalanced</li><li style='margin-bottom:2px;'>(c) Cannot be determined</li><li style='margin-bottom:2px;'>(d) None</li></ul><div style='margin-bottom:10px;'><strong>Q2.</strong> Explain the structure of a plant cell with a labeled diagram.</div><div style='text-align:center;margin:8px 0;'><img src='data:image/png;base64,' style='max-width:320px;max-height:220px;' alt='Diagram'></div>
